  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、お疲れさま",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん\r\nお疲れさまです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今年最後のライブはどうだった？\r\nしっかり楽しめたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、とっても楽しかったですっ\r\nそれに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ファンのみなさんに、\r\n今年最後のご挨拶ができてよかったです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\n真乃が満足のいく仕事納めができたようで、何よりだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お正月に仕事の予定は入れてないから\r\nしばらくはゆっくりできるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nそういえば、しばらくお休みになるんでした……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。真乃は、正月の予定はあるのか？\r\nどこか遊びに行くとか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……父や母、\r\nそれに、ピーちゃんとお家でゆっくりしてると思います",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それはいいお正月の過ごし方だな\r\n真乃がゆっくりできそうで安心したよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あっ、でも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これから少しの間、事務所のみんなに\r\n会えないんだって思うと……ちょっと寂しくなります",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "寂しいか……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "どこかで\r\nバッタリ会うかもな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "きっと、\r\nあっという間だぞ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "連絡してみても\r\nいいんじゃないか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……バッタリ、ですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、初詣に行ったら偶然……\r\nみたいなこと、結構ありそうじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あっ……\r\n確かにそうかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "約束したわけじゃないのに偶然会えると\r\nいつも以上に嬉しくなるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\nなんとなくわかります、ふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん\r\n今から初詣が楽しみになってきましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それはよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの\r\nプロデューサーさんは初詣に行かれますか？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　特に決めてはいないけど\r\n多分行くんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ。それじゃあ、プロデューサーさんとも\r\nバッタリしちゃうかもしれませんねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだかんだ言っても\r\nお正月もやることはたくさんあるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "やること、ですか……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……えっと……おせち作りのお手伝いして、\r\n親戚の人にご挨拶して、年賀状のお返事を書いて……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ……確かに、結構忙しいかもしれませんっ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nだから、そうやって忙しく過ごしてるうちに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっという間に休みが終わって、\r\nまたすぐにみんなの顔を見れることになるさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……それじゃあ、プロデューサーさんとも\r\nまたすぐに会えますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、まぁそういうことにもなるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふっ、お休み明けが楽しみですっ\r\nありがとうございます、プロデューサーさんっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010200"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010210,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、お正月で忙しかったら\r\n邪魔になっちゃうかもしれませんし……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\nでも、みんなも真乃と同じように思っているかもしれないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……\r\n遠慮してるかもしれないってことですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もしかしたらな\r\nお互いに遠慮しあって連絡しないかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、少しだけ勇気を出して\r\n真乃の方からしてみたらどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、そうですねっ\r\nたまには、私からっ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、その意気だ。その連絡がきっかけで、\r\nみんなで一緒に遊びに行くことになるかもしれないしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あの、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "えっと……\r\nプロデューサーさんにも、連絡していいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にか？　ああ、もちろんだ\r\nいつでもしてくれていいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001006010260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ、プロデューサーさん\r\nふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100601/2001006010260"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]